Package: betwixt
Title: Scoped Semantic Claims and Human Review Workflows
Version: 0.0.4
Authors@R:
    person(
      given = "Daniel",
      family = "Antal",
      email = "daniel.antal@dataobservatory.eu",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7513-6760")
    )
Description: Provides a lightweight framework for constructing, reviewing, and
   documenting candidate semantic claims in tabular data. Candidate claims can
   be organised into bounded review tasks and presented through configurable
   human review interfaces. Review decisions, states, and provenance can be
   recorded while keeping the semantic representation independent of a
   particular review interface.
